
flowchart LR
    UI["Browser UI - Chat, Chart.js, Tables"] -->|REST JSON| API["FastAPI - app/main.py"]

    API --> SM["Session Manager - Per-session state"]
    API --> AG["Agent - app/agent.py"]

    SM --> DS["Data Store - Validate, Profile, Quality"]
    DS --> DB[("DuckDB In-Memory - One table per CSV")]

    AG -->|Plan JSON| LLM["LLM Client - Anthropic or OpenAI - Retry and Cache"]
    AG -->|Fallback| OFF["Offline Heuristic Planner"]

    AG -->|Validate SQL| GUARD["SQL Guard - Read-only SELECT"]
    GUARD -->|Execute Query| DB

    DB -->|Query Result| AG

    AG -->|Repair on error - Max 2 retries| LLM

    AG --> CH["Chart Builder"]
    AG --> AN["Anomaly Detector - IQR and MAD - Group-aware"]

    AN --> DB

    AG -->|Explain Real Rows| LLM
